Title:  Didn't think like that

Seq:    5.8.53.1.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Stamp, Chris|Chris Stamp]], as quoted in *[[Quoted in Jimi Hendrix and the Making of *Are You Experienced*|Jimi Hendrix and the Making of *Are You Experienced*]]*

Body:

Didn’t think like that. Of course, one was always going for this brighter, smarter, hipper crowd. One understood that there was an audience out there that really appreciated fucking good stuff — but we weren’t doing any, like, market research. We loved this album….

